{"detail": {"templateUuid": "d87e50ae2b5e4930a4d861d987e66617", "projectUuid": "7af8f60bd0534412b92a92c5455c7781", "name": "《极夜低语》（Whispers of the Polar Night）", "description": "南极万年冰川下，科考队唤醒了沉睡的异星菌丝。在这股庞大的宇宙意识里，人类不是要消灭的敌人，而是一群因灵魂无法相通、正遭受“孤独”这种精神绝症折磨的可怜病人。为了治愈他们，它放出温和的荧光菌丝，开始精密重塑人类的神经。\n然而对未知的恐惧引发了疯狂，人类在猜忌中用烈火自相残杀，拼死抗拒它的“拯救”。防线崩溃后，被同化的“医生”在火光中走向绝望的幸存者，整条手臂爆裂成发光的触手巨网。在荧光融入脸庞、恐惧消融化作安详微笑的瞬间，他终于不再孤独。\n大火寂灭，一只带着荧质菌丝的小狗走向无垠风雪。它回头，裂开的头颅里喷出黏稠而具有智慧的菌丝，直扑你的屏幕。它说，我们痊愈了。但这究竟是进化的恩赐，还是文明的寂灭？", "coverUrl": "/assets/69589df4265326ad.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/d20421bb9cac40fb99763d309111430a/2d30dfb743621464b9b824e337bc8a904eb223e5.mp4", "snapshotId": 15607, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 3462983, "ownerUuid": "d20421bb9cac40fb99763d309111430a", "avatar": "/assets/60489f75b1a0bf42.webp", "nickname": "大大大大大", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 8, "tags": [{"id": 3035, "code": "prod", "tagLabel": "大乱斗｜vol.2《AI，想象和尖叫》", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3035/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/6a1be2500000000035032a0e?xsec_token=AB-jdwdVAwuH2j2PfEqINKMLV-aujQuFLpe80GYjehVaY=&xsec_source=pc_user", "createAt": "2026年05月31日 15:39", "updateAt": "2026年06月02日 22:19", "publishAt": "2026年05月31日 15:39", "honors": ["最佳剧情"], "awardedTag": ["最佳剧情"], "playCount": 12, "viewCreationProcessCount": 2, "copyCanvasCount": 0, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/d87e50ae2b5e4930a4d861d987e66617.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 398, "edges": 407}}, "recommendList": []